 guideTitle:['Mesin audit, di komputermu.','Your audit engine, on your computer.'],guideSubtitle:['Dashboard online membaca laporan. Pemindaian dijalankan oleh aplikasi lokal.','The online dashboard reads reports. Scanning runs in the local application.'],download:['Unduh tool v{version}','Download tool v{version}'],setupTitle:['Siapkan sekali','One-time setup'],setupBody:['Unduh dan ekstrak tool. Di Windows, klik dua kali Mulai-Event-Atlas.cmd. Untuk setup manual, pasang Node.js 20+ lalu buka terminal di folder hasil ekstrak.','Download and extract the tool. On Windows, double-click Mulai-Event-Atlas.cmd. For manual setup, install Node.js 20+ and open a terminal in the extracted folder.'],openTitle:['Buka aplikasi lokal','Open the local application'],openBody:['Jalankan perintah berikut, lalu buka alamat lokal yang muncul.','Run the following command, then open the local address shown.'],openLocal:['Buka aplikasi lokal','Open local application'],exploreTitle:['Audit, lalu eksplorasi','Audit, then explore'],exploreBody:['Masukkan domain, pilih platform, cakupan, dan kecepatan, lalu jalankan audit. Sesuaikan batas halaman dengan ukuran website dan periksa URL yang masih tersisa. Ekspor hasil sebagai CSV atau JSON.','Enter a domain and choose platforms, coverage, and speed. Match the page limit to the website size and check remaining URLs. Export the results as CSV or JSON.'],
 updateTitle:['Memperbarui versi saat audit masih berjalan','Updating while an audit is running'],updateBody:['Biarkan audit saat ini selesai, lalu ekspor JSON. Ekstrak versi baru ke folder terpisah. Setelah audit lama selesai, tutup mesin lamanya dan jalankan launcher versi baru. Pengaturan kecepatan baru berlaku untuk audit berikutnya; mengganti bahasa hanya mengubah tampilan.','Let the current audit finish, then export JSON. Extract the new release into a separate folder. Once the old audit is complete, close its engine and launch the new version. New speed settings apply to the next audit; changing language only changes the interface.'],
 knowTitle:['Yang perlu diketahui','What to know'],knowBody:['Form tidak diisi dan tindakan sensitif dilewati. Halaman login, iframe lintas origin, video, dan alur bertahap memerlukan pengujian tambahan. “Antrean selesai” tidak menjamin semua event website terinventarisasi.','Forms are not filled and sensitive actions are skipped. Login pages, cross-origin iframes, videos, and multi-step journeys require additional testing. A completed queue does not guarantee every site event has been found.'],
 changesTitle:['Riwayat perubahan','Release history'],changesSubtitle:['Setiap rilis memiliki nomor versi dan catatan perubahan. Laporan lama tetap dapat diimpor.','Every release has a version and changelog. Older reports can still be imported.'],development:['Tahap development','In development'],reportVersion:['Laporan dari mesin v{version}','Report from engine v{version}'],legacyVersion:['1.0.0 (laporan lama)','1.0.0 (older report)'],
